# GRCh38 silencer ELS source pools by chromosome

This directory contains the chromosome-specific positive silencer ELS records
and their generated synthetic negative source pools. The positive chromosome
BEDs are produced by `src/get_whole_body_silencers.sh`; positive FASTA and
negative BED/FASTA files are produced with `src/build_negs.R` through the
23-task `slurm/build_negs.sh` array.

BED and FASTA records correspond by position within each chromosome/class pair.
A negative pool is assigned to the chromosome of its source positive input. The
synthetic null BED coordinate selected by `genNullSeqs()` may lie on a different
chromosome and does not redefine that source-pool assignment.

| chromosome | source_positive_records | generated_negative_records | missing_negative_records |
