| chrX       |                   1,447 |                      1,447 |                        0 |
| **Total**  |                 **202,493** |                **202,423** |                   **70** |

The silencer ELS input contains no chrY records, so the negative-generation
array covers chr1-chr22 and chrX only. Missing counts are the final unmatched
records after `genNullSeqs()` exhausted up to 500 trials. They agree with both
the final `remaining` values in `slurmlogs/negs.1849304_*.out` and the
difference between each positive and negative BED/FASTA record count.
